3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"3euS__1BAL3ETiIuecS6ZQ","review_id":"DNYAPxdvswkbpruRxFF2ww","date":"2019-01-04T19:57:25","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9428461790084839,"text_excerpt":"This was my first visit to this location of the growing local pizza chain of Theo's and they are certainly one of my favorite pizza joints around the area. The thin crispy crust makes me a very happy eater. I enjoy the wide range of interesting combinations they offer. The Eccentric & the Spicy Mexican are two of my favorites but my usual fix is the Hippy with either chicken or meatballs added. I always get a side of their tasty marinara to dip my crust into; although often it isn't needed I still love the sauce and will just drink it! I also really like their meatball sub which is what I ate at this location and it was consistent with my good experiences at their other locations."},{"business_id":"3euS__1BAL3ETiIuecS6ZQ","review_id":"oGZcmZ4Og4QmEWI4MrTiHw","date":"2013-12-29T20:26:32","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9342588782310486,"text_excerpt":"I was out in Elmwood when I decided that a takeout pizza was just the thing to make the rest of my evening. And since I'm a big fan of the other Theo's locations, I stopped in. This is definitely the largest of the Theo's and if I had a big group, to dine in, then I might trek out to Elmwood instead of to my closer uptown location. The staff was courteous and professional. The menu seems to be the same at all 3 locations (although I would guess the specials might be unique to location). I'm a big fan of their crust which is thin and crackery like."},{"business_id":"3euS__1BAL3ETiIuecS6ZQ","review_id":"qpmZIOi3uX3kgcq_OBaGkQ","date":"2012-12-30T04:12:25","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9330418109893799,"text_excerpt":"Theo's has great pizza - thin crispy crust. Lots of specialty pizzas ranging from your typical pepperoni to everything but the kitchen zink. I find the ingredients to be fresh and very good quality. One of the servers told me they get their bread from La Louisiane bakery...thought that was cool. Salads are great too and big enough to share. I would pass on the wings next time."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"3euS__1BAL3ETiIuecS6ZQ","photo_id":"2LpBqem_ilzXCh3pz13M9g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/2LpBqem_ilzXCh3pz13M9g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8917666673660278},{"business_id":"3euS__1BAL3ETiIuecS6ZQ","photo_id":"cay5qOlaMXMKIHAhwvn2fQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/cay5qOlaMXMKIHAhwvn2fQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8016723990440369},{"business_id":"3euS__1BAL3ETiIuecS6ZQ","photo_id":"SZ3mlYutVRyRNJ2FoIdPWQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/SZ3mlYutVRyRNJ2FoIdPWQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7881433963775635}]},"notebook_case":null}
